window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I’ve loved Magnus for as long as I can remember, but he’s always had his eyes on someone else. My magical familiar insists I make my move and get it over with before it’s too late. After all, Magnus and I have spent years together in highschool, but with his world falling apart on the eve of his greatest heartbreak, I finally take my chance.</p> <p>There’s just one problem: while Magnus is heading off to college, I’m on the verge of being accepted into the Order Academy—a school in a magical realm I can’t tell anyone about, not even my parents. How could I confess my love without also telling him I’m leaving this world—and him—behind forever?</p> <p>I can’t stand the thought of never knowing what might have been between us, so I’m going to risk it all—no matter the consequences.<br> <br> <b>One night is worth the risk... isn't it?</b></p> <p>But Magnus is hiding a secret far darker than I ever imagined. And as I get closer, I realize I might just unravel more than I bargained for.</p> <p>This is a tragic romantasy character origin story for an upcoming series.</p>"; 
